    <description>DriverGeek lists every driver on the machine with its version, date and publisher, and surfaces the
driver updates Windows Update keeps tucked away under optional updates.

* Full inventory of installed drivers, sortable and searchable
* Shows the optional driver updates Windows offers but does not push
* Export the inventory, which is what you actually want before a rebuild
* Does not download drivers from third-party sites - everything comes from Windows Update
* No account, no adverts, no bundled offers

Open source under GPL-3.0. The .NET 8 runtime is bundled, so there is nothing to install first.</description>
    <summary>Free driver inventory for Windows, including the updates hidden under optional updates</summary>
